alton was going to be Mitch's <strong>opponent</strong>.</p>    <p style=\"margin-bottom: 1rem;\">The game started. Every time Mitch tried to hit the ball over the net, Dalton stopped it. Finally, Mitch used all of his strength. But the ball <strong>bounced</strong> off Dalton's hands and back into Mitch's face! Finally Mitch was <strong>defeated</strong>.</p></div>",
